button-Hero_04 = Girl, fair skin, blond hair, blue eyes, red beanie with a white patterned band, yellow top
button-Hero_05 = Girl, light skin, black hair, grey eyes, red beanie with a white patterned band, yellow top
button-Hero_06 = Girl, tan skin, dark brown hair, brown eyes, red beanie with a white patterned band, yellow top
